---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact | Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="Contact Ruhani Creations by Sumati for orders, studio visits, Instagram, Google reviews, and design-led customer support from Agra."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container page-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
          <h1>Speak with the studio, visit us in Agra, or connect through the channel that fits your order best.</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">
            Whether you want to place an order, confirm an appointment, ask about a design idea, or leave a review, everything you need is here in one place.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="/how-to-order">Ordering steps</a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/catalog">Browse catalog</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/generated/rcbs-emblem-dark.png" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati emblem">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container page-stack">
      <section class="page-panel contact-layout">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Communication Channels</p>
          <h2>Choose the fastest route based on what you need.</h2>
          <div class="contact-channel-grid">
            <article class="contact-channel">
              <div class="contact-channel-head">
                <span class="contact-icon icon-whatsapp">WA</span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-tag">Orders &amp; Appointments</span>
                  <h3>WhatsApp</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>Best for quick product checks, availability, studio visit scheduling, and order conversations.</p>
              <p><a href="https://wa.me/919105114152" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">+91 91051 14152</a></p>
            </article>
            <article class="contact-channel">
              <div class="contact-channel-head">
                <span class="contact-icon icon-email">@</span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-tag">Official Mail</span>
                  <h3>Email</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>Use email when you want a written thread for support, orders, gifting requirements, or repeat coordination.</p>
              <div class="contact-mail-stack">
                <a href="mailto:support@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com">support@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com</a>
                <a href="mailto:order@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com">order@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="contact-channel">
              <div class="contact-channel-head">
                <span class="contact-icon icon-instagram">IG</span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-tag">Latest Work</span>
                  <h3>Instagram</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>See new looks, styling ideas, reels, and recent work from the studio.</p>
              <p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/ruhani.creations/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@ruhani.creations</a></p>
            </article>
            <article class="contact-channel">
              <div class="contact-channel-head">
                <span class="contact-icon icon-facebook">FB</span>
                <div>
                  <span class="contact-tag">Community</span>
                  <h3>Facebook</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>Follow the page for updates and social sharing around the brand.</p>
              <p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1BF1LsCzts/?mibextid=wwXIfr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Facebook profile</a></p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hours-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Studio Details</p>
          <h3>DayalBagh, Agra</h3>
          <p>Ruhani Creations by Sumati<br>B27, Sarlabagh Extension, DayalBagh, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282005</p>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a class="button primary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ruhani%20Creations%20by%20Sumati%2C%20B27%2C%20Sarlabagh%20Extension%2C%20DayalBagh%2C%20Agra%2C%20Uttar%20Pradesh%20282005" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open in Google Maps</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hours-grid">
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Monday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Tuesday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Wednesday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Thursday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Friday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Saturday</span><span>10 am - 7:30 pm</span></div>
            <div class="hours-row"><span>Sunday</span><span>10 am - 5:30 pm</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="listing-note">
            <span class="contact-icon icon-review">GB</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Google Business is listed as Ruhani Creations by Sumati.</strong>
              <p>Search it directly on Google Maps to find directions, timings, and the review profile.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="page-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scan &amp; Connect</p>
        <h2>Instagram and Google review access, side by side.</h2>
        <div class="qr-grid">
          <article class="qr-card">
            <div class="qr-frame">
              <img src="/assets/instagram-qr.png" alt="Instagram QR code for Ruhani Creations by Sumati">
            </div>
            <h3>Instagram</h3>
            <p>Scan to open our Instagram profile and explore current product updates, styling visuals, and reels.</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
              <a class="button ghost" href="https://www.instagram.com/ruhani.creations/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Instagram</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="qr-card">
            <div class="qr-frame">
              <img src="/assets/google-review-qr.png" alt="Google review QR code for Ruhani Creations by Sumati">
            </div>
            <h3>Google Reviews</h3>
            <p>Scan to review us on Google or open our listing directly on Google Maps.</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
              <a class="button ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ruhani%20Creations%20by%20Sumati%2C%20Agra" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Google listing</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>